/**
 * @defgroup StVMCMaker StVMCMaker — STAR Chain Maker for VMC Simulation
 * @brief StMaker that drives StarVMCApplication from within the STAR BFC.
 *
 * StVMCMaker integrates the VMC simulation into the standard STAR chain.
 * It owns the StarVMCApplication singleton and the TGeant3TGeo engine,
 * initialises the full simulation stack in Init(), and processes one
 * event per Make() call.  TGeoDrawHelper provides the TGeo-to-TVolume
 * conversion needed by the STAR event display.
 * @{
 */

/**
 * @class StVMCMaker
 * @brief StMaker driving the STAR VMC simulation from the BFC.
 *
 * Init() creates StarVMCApplication, TGeant3TGeo, a primary generator
 * (StarMCHBPrimaryGenerator if an input file is set, otherwise
 * StarMCSimplePrimaryGenerator), and StarMCHits; then calls
 * appl->InitMC() which invokes gMC->SetStack / Init / BuildPhysics and
 * sets up all hit descriptors.
 *
 * InitRun() propagates the run number and date/time to GEANT3 and the
 * event header.
 *
 * Make() calls appl->RunMC(1), which processes a single event through the
 * full GEANT3 transport loop (GeneratePrimaries, Field, PreTrack,
 * Stepping / hits->Step / FillG2Table, PostTrack, FinishEvent).
 *
 * Clear() resets per-event state.  Finish() finalises the MC run.
 *
 * SetDateTime(idat, itim) sets the GEANT3 date/time (YYYYMMDD, HHMMSS).
 * SetRunNo(m) sets the run number (clamped to [1, 999999]).
 * SetInputFile(fileName) enables StarMCHBPrimaryGenerator for HBT input.
 * Skip(n) advances the input reader by n events without simulating.
 *
 * Static accessors: GetStarVMCApplication(), GetGeant3(), GetVolume().
 */

/**
 * @class TGeoDrawHelper
 * @brief Converts a TGeoVolume tree to the legacy TVolume/TShape tree.
 *
 * Used by StVMCMaker::InitRun() to build the TVolume representation of the
 * STAR geometry for the TGeometry-based event display.
 *
 * MakeVolume(top, map) recursively converts a TGeoVolume subtree.
 * MakeShape() dispatches on the concrete TGeo shape type and creates the
 * corresponding legacy TShape: TGeoBBox→TBRIK, TGeoTube→TTUBE,
 * TGeoTubeSeg→TTUBS, TGeoCone→TCONE, TGeoConeSeg→TCONS, TGeoPcon→TPCON,
 * TGeoPgon→TPGON, TGeoEltu→TELTU, TGeoTrap→TTRAP, TGeoCtub→TCTUB,
 * TGeoTrd1→TTRD1, TGeoTrd2→TTRD2, TGeoGtra→TGTRA, TGeoSphere→TSPHE,
 * TGeoArb8→TARB8, TGeoPara→TPARA.
 * Draw() and Paint() delegate to the constructed TVolume.
 */

/**
 * @}
 */
